    "content": "## Scenario explorer\nPick a **scenario** and the **methods** to compare at the top. Each curve is one full year (2025-10-19 to 2026-10-18) of daily operation, starting at 50% storage. Watch the *storage* chart: good operation stays above the 20% reserve and finishes near the 50% target.  \n_Modelled study dataset (not observed CEB telemetry) - decision support only._"
